{"synopsis":"Da-in akhirnya merasuki penjahat dalam sebuah cerita.\n\nUntuk membahagiakan Stardust — protagonis cerita dan karakter favoritnya dalam manga distopia — ia memutuskan untuk menjadi penjahat yang egois demi perkembangannya.\n\nDa-in sengaja menciptakan teror untuk meningkatkan kemampuan Stardust dan secara preemptif mencegah semua peristiwa tragis dari cerita aslinya, tetapi dalam prosesnya, ia mendapatkan dukungan publik sekaligus memancing kecurigaan Stardust.\n\nStardust, yang awalnya menentangnya, perlahan membuka hatinya, dan bahkan segera mulai menunjukkan tanda-tanda obsesi terhadapnya…?","alternative_title":"히어로가 집착하는 악당이 되었다","author":"Hamdeok","artist":"Contimaker Studio","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"bd15c7b3-cb0f-40c8-9b70-398364557b41","number":"59","chapter":"59","title":"","date":"2026-06-21","released":"2026-06-21","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_06070d63-78ac-4918-b004-dee77102f294/chapter_ch_59/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_06070d63-78ac-4918-b004-dee77102f294/chapter_ch_59/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_06070d63-78ac-4918-b004-dee77102f294/chapter_ch_59/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_06070d63-78ac-4918-b004-dee77102f294/chapter_ch_59/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_06070d63-78ac-4918-b004-dee77102f294/chapter_ch_59/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_06070d63-78ac-4918-b004-dee77102f294/chapter_ch_59/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_06070d63-78ac-4918-b004-dee77102f294/chapter_ch_59/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_06070d63-78ac-4918-b004-dee77102f294/chapter_ch_59/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_06070d63-78ac-4918-b004-dee77102f294/chapter_ch_59/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_06070d63-78ac-4918-b004-dee77102f294/chapter_ch_59/10.webp"]},{"chapter_id":"1eaa6170-59bb-4a23-b555-c07da0e9435d","number":"58","chapter":"58","title":"","date":"2026-06-09","released":"2026-06-09","images":["https:/